{"step_index":367,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T15:46:52Z","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Walkthrough updated with the 1-Tap Proof of Contact & Original Scanned Card Viewer modal for live verification and compliance.","UserFacing":true},"CodeContent":"# Walkthrough: Proof of Contact & Original Card Viewer\n\nThe **SnapDialer** app at [`C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer) now includes an instant **1-Tap Proof of Contact & Original Report Card Viewer**.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Compliance & Verification Proof Modal ([`src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/DialerHudScreen.tsx) & [`src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/screens/LeadDetailScreen.tsx))\n- **1-Tap \"View Original Report Card (Proof of Request)\":**\n  - Positioned directly on the Educator Contact Card in the Power Dialer HUD and in the Lead Profile.\n  - Pops up a high-resolution preview of the educator's original physical card.\n- **Key Use Cases:**\n  1. **Handwriting Double-Check:** Easily read unclear teacher handwriting for notes or room numbers mid-call.\n  2. **Express Written Consent Proof:** Serves as permanent evidence of the educator's explicit request for a retirement analysis.\n  3. **Verified Badge:** Highlights *\"Verified Written Consent & Report Card Submission on Record\"*.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Storage Architecture:\n- Scanned document images are permanently stored in device storage sandbox (`FileSystem.documentDirectory`).\n- SQLite stores the `source_image_uri` reference on both the `lists` and `leads` tables.\n\n---\n\n## How to Test:\n1. Refresh `http://localhost:8081`.\n2. Tap **Launch Power Dialer** on the **ValuTeachers - Volusia School Roster**.\n3. Tap **View Original Report Card (Proof of Request)** to inspect the physical card photo in full resolution!\n","Description":"Walkthrough covering Proof of Contact and Original Card Viewer","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\walkthrough.md","toolAction":"Updating walkthrough for Proof of Contact modal","toolSummary":"Update walkthrough.md with Proof of Contact modal"}}]}
