{"step_index":373,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-20T16:13:49Z","thinking":"**Crafting Persuasive Text**\n\nI'm focusing on how to make text messages subtly persuasive once the Gemini API key is integrated. The goal is for the agent to use prior notes and call logs to construct the messages. I'm also ensuring the user has a chance to review and modify any text before it is sent.\n\n\n**Developing AI Text Generation**\n\nI've been working on a new \"AI Draft SMS\" feature, activated by tapping \"ValuTeachers SMS\". This uses Gemini with the lead's full context, including their profile and past interactions. I'm focusing on crafting an effective system prompt instructing Gemini to generate subtly persuasive, professional, and concise SMS messages tailored for educators, using relevant information such as the checked needs and meeting availability.\n\n\n**Refining Text Strategy**\n\nI'm now zeroing in on message content. I need to make sure the messages naturally incorporate the lead's retirement \"hot button,\" preferred planning period, and meeting availability, all while maintaining a helpful, consultative tone. Conciseness is key, with a target of 160-240 characters for mobile readability. I've also focused on the SMS Modal text editor to provide a preview of the generated text, for review, editing, and revision before sending. I've included AI regeneration options for convenience. Offline and API key fallback solutions are also available. Finally, I plan to build a dedicated `src/services/aiSmsService.ts` to manage this feature.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"import { Lead, CallLog, AppSettings } from '../types';\nimport { SettingsRepository } from '../db/settingsRepository';\nimport { CallLogsRepository } from '../db/callLogsRepository';\n\nexport class AiSmsService {\n  /**\n   * Generates a subtly persuasive, warm, and tailored SMS message for Florida educators\n   * based on their FRS Report Card, previous call logs, and meeting preferences.\n   */\n  static async generatePersuasiveSMS(\n    lead: Lead,\n    currentDisposition?: string,\n    providedApiKey?: string,\n    toneFocus?: 'meeting_confirmation' | 'unanswered_followup' | 'drop_bonus_focus' | 'planning_period'\n  ): Promise<string> {\n    let key = providedApiKey;\n    if (!key || key.trim().length === 0) {\n      const settings = await SettingsRepository.getSettings();\n      key = settings.gemini_api_key;\n    }\n\n    // If no API key, return a high-converting default ValuTeachers template\n    if (!key || key.trim().length === 0) {\n      return this.getFallbackSMS(lead);\n    }\n\n    try {\n      const history = await CallLogsRepository.getLogsForLead(lead.id);\n      const settings = await SettingsRepository.getSettings();\n      const agentName = settings.user_name || 'Alex';\n\n      const historySummary = history\n        .slice(0, 4)\n        .map(\n          (h) =>\n            `- Attempt at ${new Date(h.timestamp).toLocaleDateString()}: Disposition \"${h.disposition}\"${\n              h.note ? `, Note: \"${h.note}\"` : ''\n            }`\n        )\n        .join('\\n');\n\n      const preferredTimes = (lead.meeting_preferences || []).join(', ') || 'planning period';\n      const interests = (lead.frs_interests || []).join(', ') || 'Florida State Retirement & 403(b) options';\n\n      const prompt = `\nYou are an expert sales copywriter specialized in educational finance and retirement planning for Florida public school teachers (Florida Retirement System / FRS) working on behalf of ValuTeachers.\n\nContext for Educator:\n- Educator Name: ${lead.name}\n- School / District: ${lead.school || 'Florida School District'}\n- Planning Period / Room: ${lead.planning_period || 'N/A'}, Room ${lead.room_number || 'N/A'}\n- Years in FRS: ${lead.years_in_frs || 'N/A'} years\n- FRS Knowledge Level: \"${lead.frs_knowledge || 'Moderate'}\"\n- Specific Needs / Inquiries Checked on Report Card: ${interests}\n- Educator's Written Question: \"${lead.custom_questions || 'None'}\"\n- Requested Meeting Availability: ${preferredTimes}\n- Current Call Outcome: ${currentDisposition || 'Follow-up'}\n- Previous Contact History & Notes:\n${historySummary || 'First outreach attempt.'}\n- ValuTeachers Representative Name: ${agentName}\n\nTone & Strategy Guidelines:\n1. Extremely, yet SUBTLY persuasive, empathetic, highly professional, and respectful of a busy teacher's schedule.\n2. Sound like a dedicated local educator advocate, NEVER like a spammy or aggressive salesperson.\n3. Reference their school (${lead.school || 'your school'}) or their specific inquiry (e.g. 5% bonus, DROP options, or 403b clarity) naturally so they recognize their own submission.\n4. If they requested specific meeting times (${preferredTimes}), reference it directly so it feels like a seamless confirmation.\n5. Keep it concise (under 200-240 characters) so it reads effortlessly on mobile lock screens.\n6. Provide a frictionless low-pressure call to action (e.g. \"Does [time] still work for a quick 5-min review, or is tomorrow better?\").\n7. Output ONLY the raw SMS text message. Do not wrap in quotes or add conversational preamble.\n`;\n\n      const endpoint = `https://generativelanguage.googleapis.com/v1beta/models/gemini-2.5-flash:generateContent?key=${key}`;\n\n      const response = await fetch(endpoint, {\n        method: 'POST',\n        headers: { 'Content-Type': 'application/json' },\n        body: JSON.stringify({\n          contents: [{ parts: [{ text: prompt }] }],\n          generationConfig: {\n            temperature: 0.3,\n            maxOutputTokens: 180,\n          },\n        }),\n      });\n\n      if (!response.ok) {\n        throw new Error(`Gemini API returned status ${response.status}`);\n      }\n\n      const data = await response.json();\n      const text = data?.candidates?.[0]?.content?.parts?.[0]?.text?.trim();\n      if (text) {\n        return text.replace(/^[\"']|[\"']$/g, '');\n      }\n    } catch (e) {\n      console.warn('AI SMS generation failed, falling back to local copy:', e);\n    }\n\n    return this.getFallbackSMS(lead);\n  }\n\n  private static getFallbackSMS(lead: Lead): string {\n    const firstName = lead.name ? lead.name.split(' ')[0] : 'there';\n    const primaryTime =\n      lead.meeting_preferences && lead.meeting_preferences.length > 0\n        ? lead.meeting_preferences[0].replace(/^[0-9]\\.\\s*/, '')\n        : 'during your planning period';\n\n    if (lead.years_in_frs && parseInt(lead.years_in_frs, 10) >= 15) {\n      return `Hi ${firstName}, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. Received your FRS Report Card from ${lead.school || 'your school'} regarding your ${lead.years_in_frs} years of service and DROP options. I see you requested ${primaryTime}—does that time still work for a quick review?`;\n    }\n\n    return `Hi ${firstName}, this is Alex with ValuTeachers. I have your FRS Report Card from ${lead.school || 'your school'} regarding your retirement & 403(b) options. I see you requested to connect on ${primaryTime}. Does that still work for a quick 5-min review?`;\n  }\n}\n","Description":"AiSmsService for generating subtly persuasive, context-aware SMS messages using Gemini 2.5 Flash","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\brorm\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\snap-dialer\\src\\services\\aiSmsService.ts","toolAction":"Writing AiSmsService","toolSummary":"Write AiSmsService.ts"}}]}
